      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Hello, world!&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;hello-world&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#hello-world&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My name is &lt;strong&gt;Weiyu Shen 沈威宇&lt;/strong&gt;, also known as &lt;strong&gt;Willie169&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Willie Shen&lt;/strong&gt;. I graduated from &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.ck.tp.edu.tw&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taipei Municipal Chien Kuo High School (CKHS) 臺北市立建國高級中學&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; in 2025 and am currently an 19-year-old undergraduate in &lt;a href=&#34;https://web.ee.ntu.edu.tw&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;National Taiwan University Department of Electrical Engineering (NTUEE) 國立臺灣大學電機工程學系&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Mastodon: &lt;a href=&#34;https://mastodon.social/@willie_shen&#34; rel=&#34;me&#34;&gt;https://mastodon.social/@willie_shen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Matrix: &lt;a href=&#34;https://matrix.org&#34;&gt;@willie169:matrix.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Languages I Use&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;languages-i-use&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#languages-i-use&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&l